            "review_title": "Review at Lumiere Byblos- Mediterranean Cuisine",
            "review_text": "Kimmie L\n4 contributions\n0\nYUMMY FOOD!\nMay 2025 • Solo\nFound this hidden gem located in Holiday Inn and Republic Plaza Apartment. Nhung was fantastic and so sweet. The food came out so fast. I thought i had to wait for about 20 minutes. I was wrong. Just 5 mins! I will most likely come back and recommend others to stop by!!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 26, 2025",
